{"id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-logic.md","title":"Logic","display":"df-logic — Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-logic","aliases":["58-df-logic","Logic"],"display":"df-logic — Logic","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-logic</span><span>Logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logic — Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\pi\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\pi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>（一阶语言谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma\\)</span>（公式集与自由变元算子）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>（此处定义的句子集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span>（结构与赋值谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[s]\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[s]\\)</span>（满足关系，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\)</span>（有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>-证明谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma[s])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma[s])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}consequence} \\vdash \\Gamma\\models_\\Sigma\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\to\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[s])\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}consequence} \\vdash \\Gamma\\models_\\Sigma\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall\\mathcal M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal M\\models_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\to\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[s])\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}provability} \\vdash \\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logic\\text{-}provability} \\vdash \\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>一阶完备性定理断言对适当的可靠且完备证明系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_\\Sigma\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_\\Sigma\\varphi\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对递归可公理化理论，“存在一个有限证明”是递归可枚举（可表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span>）的；该结论需要有效编码假设。</li>\n<li>一阶有效性是递归可枚举完备且不可判定，不是 coNP-complete。</li>\n<li>coNP-complete 描述的是命题逻辑有效性（在通常有限编码下），不能移用于一阶逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mendelson, Introduction to Mathematical Logic</li>\n<li>Ebbinghaus, Flum and Thomas, Mathematical Logic</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof.md","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","embed":false},{"target":".